{
  "name": "Martial Mastery",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the mastery benefits for two weapons of your choice as well as an armor type (see Armor Mastery and Weapon Mastery variant rules). You must be proficient in the chosen weapons and armor. If you possess the Unarmored Defense feature, you may choose it in place of an armor type.</p><p>You can change your choices when you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>",
